# spec: every method the client recognises by name, one request each
### get
GET https://api.example.com/things
### post
POST https://api.example.com/things
Content-Type: application/json

{"a":1}
### put
PUT https://api.example.com/things/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"a":2}
### patch
PATCH https://api.example.com/things/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"a":3}
### delete
DELETE https://api.example.com/things/1
### head
HEAD https://api.example.com/things
### options
OPTIONS https://api.example.com/things
### trace
TRACE https://api.example.com/things
### connect
CONNECT proxy.example.com:8443
### websocket
WEBSOCKET wss://echo.example.com/socket
